      "voice_style_en": "A crisp, confident product-film narrator with native American English delivery. Forward-moving conversational energy, clear stresses and short natural pauses. No whispering, bedtime softness, breathy luxury affectation, newsreader cadence or shouty sales pitch. Finish short lines briskly; never stretch them to fill a slot.",
